<title>UK: ABN AMRO sets warrants on Christian Dior.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets warrants on Christian Dior.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank NV has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Christian Dior, lead manager ABN AMRO Finance SA said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    920.00 FRF		PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     11.20 FRF		 GEARING	7.47 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	19.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
